  --
  {#
    Username | Full name | Type | Parties | Roles | State | Last sign-in
    jdoe | Jane Doe | user | Acme Bank | Trading, Viewer | Online | 2 hours ago
    rsmith | Robert Smith | user | Acme Bank, Acme Capital | Admin | Locked | 3 days ago
    feed_loader | service account | service | Acme Bank | Ingest | Offline | 1 hour ago
  }
  --
  {#
    Selected account | State
    Locked | yes
    Online | no
    Last sign-in | 3 days ago
    Password change due | yes
  }
  --
  [ Refresh ] | [ Export ]
}

